<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0653_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? I can’t hear you. The\nconnection trash.\rCall back from somewhere else!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nWhat’s goin’ on?\fI’m doin’ great.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s stronger Block Bosses than\nme out there. They all waitin’ to\fcheer you on!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s right... If we gon’ have\nanother scrap, we gotta do it\fwhen I’m free, like Tuesday nights.\rHit me up then.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m completely free today.\nWhy don’t we scrap? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight!\rYou know where the Saffron Dojo at?\nI’ll be waitin’ there.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\nWell, you got your own plans too,\fI get it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! Before you scrap me again, ain’t\nthere somebody else you promised to\fscrap?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll be at the Saffron Dojo.\nGet ready and meet me there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Morty!\nHow you doin’?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, didn’t we make plans to meet at\nthe Saffron Dojo?\fI remembered!\fYou ain’t forget, did you?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The legendary homies: Suicune, Entei,\nand Raikou--which one you like best?\rUnlike Eusine, I ain’t deadass\nthat into Suicune.\rSo I’d have to say Entei...\nBut I can’t leave out Raikou...\fHmm... Guess I can’t decide.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I saw Entei once. Like\nup close. It was crazy.\rEntei looked me dead in the eyes. I’ll\nnever forget them eyes.\rIt was like it could see right through\nme, down to the bottom of my heart...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0653_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How you been?\nAnything interestin’ happenin’?\rI’m doin’ the usual, just my\nregular Block Boss stuff.\rAin’t been no deadass strong\nHustlers here since you came through.\rSeem like you one of them genius\nHustlers you rarely meet.\rHa ha ha! I ain’t tryna gas you up!</language>
	</row>
</body>
